"构建与发布","主题",[60,86,91,92,93],"tags","Edit mode","Play mode","命令行工具","延伸阅读",[96,97],{"_55":100,"_25":101},{"_55":98,"_25":99},"Versioned test-job and cancellation API","https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.test-framework@1.4/api/UnityEditor.TestTools.TestRunner.Api.TestRunnerApi.html","Package and API documentation","https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.test-framework@latest/","项目源码",[104],{"_55":102,"_25":105},"https://docs.unity3d.com/6000.2/Documentation/Manual/test-framework/test-framework-introduction.html","用途与特点","可持续回归检查生成脚本及场景行为，使用跨帧 UnityTest 检查生命周期、协程与状态变化。Edit mode 和 Play mode 的执行循环不同，应等待真实帧或条件，而不只检查脚本文件生成。所检查的 Test Framework 1.4.6 API 返回任务 GUID，取消时有跨帧清理：活动用例变为 Canceled，剩余用例为 NotRun。取消不能算通过，Editor 与包版本的兼容性需分别确认。","detail","guidance","资源类型","工具","分类","引擎与制作工具","category","lead","summary","name","engines","tool",[131,132],[60,129,91,92,130],[126,127,128],[124,125],"2d","3d","code","test","ship","Testing","CLI",{"_55":100,"_25":101},{"_55":98,"_25":99},{"_134":135},"documents",{"_68":136,"_35":137},[139,143,144,145,142,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,141,178,140,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199],[138,139,140,141,142],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluatio